Error [E0120]: `id` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> tests/ui/single_use_consume_unaudited.jet:6:24
    |
  6 |     return Ticket.{id: id}
    |                        ^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: copy it explicitly with `~id`

Error [E0143]: `t` is `#SingleUse` — discarding it with `consume` needs an audited reason
  --> tests/ui/single_use_consume_unaudited.jet:11:13
    |
 11 |     consume(t)
    |             ^
 Why: this value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it carries a job that has to be done; deliberately throwing it away skips that job, which is exactly the kind of decision that has to be written down
 Fix: wrap it in an audited region: `#Unsafe("why discarding this is fine") { consume(t) }`
